      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KISAUNI (4) is a well performed dog and winner of 47 races who is worth forgiving after finishing out of the placings at Wentworth Park (30.31). Form from his last run is proving strong. Better than last start and worth following up. EPIC STORY (1) led early but gathered in and found a bit of trouble before missing the frame with a 68 length sixth (35.28) in a Invitation at Angle Park. May be worth another try. TAKE THE STEPS (8) broke a string of placings finishing in the money four on end before a last start fourth (31.00) at Angle Park. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from three starts. Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to his name from seven starts. Has ability and can measure up. SHINY PISTOL (2) cannot be underestimated.",
